     MouseAppearanceTag["LinkHand"]]& )]],ExpressionUUID->
  "093ca360-c10e-4114-92fe-eeb37cc20935"],
 " Framework",
 ": Wolfram Web Forms parse and validate user inputs into rich symbolic \
Wolfram expressions automatically:"
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"02fdb1e8-8685-406f-88be-1dcfa1853181"],

